  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="cd402fd2-8c3f-56cf-895e-3e35b616de1f" activityNameId="4583f36c-294b-56ca-be0d-f64ff9bd420a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rock wool, packed, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rock wool, packed, at plant
With functional unit kg, this module can be used for rock wool products with different densities. For the calculation of the packaging material demand, 100 kg/m3 are assumed (volume: 2.4m3, load weight: 250 kg). Inputs and outputs are not balanced in the unit process since some are included in the unit process "rock wool, at plant".;
Synonyms: mineralisch, Isolation, Dämm, matte, platte, mineral, insulation, mat, board; 
UUID: 0a20bc7c-7f84-3bb6-94e9-a022fd5cd057
Includes mechanical packing and the administration of the rock wool factory.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The company Flumroc AG works on a technically high level. The packing and loading process is automated.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 112500t/a
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: see geography and technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Assumption: the production of Flumroc of 57'761 t per year is representative for the total consumed rock wool products in Switzerland.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a20bc7c-7f84-3bb6-94e9-a022fd5cd057.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
